<title>CANADA: Philip completes debentures conversion.</title>
<headline>Philip completes debentures conversion.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource recovery company Philip Environmental Inc said on Wednesday all its outstanding 6 percent subordinated debentures were converted into common shares.</p>
<p>Philip now has 67,390,296 common shares issued and outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>Philip issued US$120 million of convertible debentures in December 1993, it said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
